摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"模型回合结束后用 LLM 生成 3 条批判性跟进建议，点击即发送 | After a model turn, an LLM generates 3 critical follow-up suggestions shown as click-to-send chips","id":"gh:1329448333","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-auto-blame","slug":"HuanLinOTO/dsh-plugin-auto-blame","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"模型回合结束后用 LLM 生成 3 条批判性跟进建议，点击即发送 | After a model turn, an LLM generates 3 critical follow-up suggest"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ions shown as click-to-send chips"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-auto-blame"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"当模型完成当前轮次对话后，将最后 3 条消息发送给 LLM，生成 3 条批判性跟进请求，显示在输入框上方作为可选项，点击直接发送。生成期间\"领导视野\"标签带 DeepSeek 蓝色流光扫过（同 Dee"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"p diving... 特效），建议到达后气泡依次淡入。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 工作原理"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **fire-and-forget**：LLM 调用不阻塞 turn 关闭，建议晚几百 ms 出现\n- **非 surface 事件**：`auto-blame/suggestions` 不进入 "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"model-visible 历史，不干扰 agent loop\n- **失败静默**：LLM 失败 / 解析失败 → 不 append 事件，不显示气泡\n- **点击发送**：走 InputBar 同"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"一路径（`inputActions.setDraft + submit`）\n- **下一轮清空**：新 turn 开始时 projection 归零，旧气泡立即消失"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 开发"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 依赖链接（sibling dsh checkout）"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"本插件依赖 `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` workspace 包。开发时需要手动 Junction 链接到 sibling dsh checkout："},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"或从 `dsh-spur` 复制 `node_modules`（含 typescript / tsdown / vitest / @types/* / cordis / @deepseek-ai/ds"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"h-client-*），再补建 `dsh-agent` / `dsh-llm` / `dsh-session` / `dsh-session-projection` 的 Junction。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 运行"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"安装后重启 `dsh web` + 浏览器硬刷新（`Ctrl+Shift+R`）。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 检查"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- [x] 零源码 patch\n- [x] `package.json` 声明 `dsh.bundle.patch`\n- [x] `cordis.patch.yml` insert 行 id/name"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"/config 齐全\n- [x] `files` 含 `lib/` + `cordis.patch.yml`\n- [x] `peerDependencies` 含 cordis + `@deepsee"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"k-ai/*`\n- [x] typecheck / test / build script 齐全\n- [x] 预构建策略（`lib/` 入库，无 `prepare` 脚本）\n- [x] 不导出 def"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ault\n- [x] 测试分层（Unit）"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
